WEBVTT

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:28.410
lf...

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:31.740
I hadn't taken
Jonathan Joestar's body...

00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:36.410
I could not have survived
for one hundred long years.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:40.380
However...

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:44.820
This body seems to be linked
to Jonathan's descendents.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.360
What is it that
concerns you...

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:51.800
Lord Dio?

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:55.100
Joestar's bloodline.

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:59.340
They suspect my existence...

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:04.640
and this new power I acquired
from having Jonathan's body...

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:06.450
the Stand!

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:08.140
But...

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:09.250
this Stand...

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:12.290
is even affecting the
bodies of his descendants.

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:15.560
Strength and weakness are
two sides of the same coin,

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:17.490
and nothing ever goes
the way one wants it to...

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:19.950
but Lord Dio,

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:21.390
please feel reassured.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:22.960
Already...

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:24.630
the necessary actions...

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.290
have been taken.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:36.680
Hey, Holley!

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:53.320
Holley!

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:54.150
What's wrong?

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:57.290
Papa...

00:04:58.770 --> 00:04:59.790
Nothing's wrong.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.130
Lately, I just haven't
gotten enough sleep.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:06.170
Are you sure nothing's wrong?

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:09.730
I'm fine, Papa!

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:11.670
You worry too much.

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:15.480
Alright...

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:19.550
Jotaro made us
all worry too much.

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:20.390
You should go rest now.

00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:21.750
Don't be silly, Papa.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:22.650
What do you need?

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:24.880
Ah... that's right.

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:28.660
We should be getting some response
from the Speed Wagon Foundation...

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:31.190
but I don't know where
the fax machine is.

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:34.530
Ah! It's in the room
across from the kitchen.

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:36.990
I'll bring it to you later.

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:39.330
Please.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:42.140
By the way, where's Jotaro?

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:44.370
School, of course!

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.140
Morning, JoJo!

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:49.650
JoJo, morning!

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:50.310
Morning!

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:51.670
JoJo!

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:55.460
Hey, JoJo, how come you didn't
come to school for four days?

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:58.360
Hey, you! What're you
rubbing against JoJo's arm?

00:05:58.590 --> 00:05:59.790
What's your problem, ugly?

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:01.500
You shut up, flat-chest!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:02.500
Ugly!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:03.590
Flat-chest!

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:05.470
How dare you, ugly!

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:07.260
How dare you!

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:08.300
Enough already!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.870
Ugly! Ugly! Ugly, ugly, ugly!

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:10.700
Flat-chest!

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:11.810
Shut up, ugly!

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:12.610
Flat-chest!

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:15.210
I don't want an ugly
girl calling me that, ugly!

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:16.940
I don't want no flat-chest telling
me that either, you flat-chest!

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:17.780
Hey! Don't go near JoJo!

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:19.810
No, you! Stay away from JoJo!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:20.680
Walk behind us!

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:21.950
No, you go walk behind us!

00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:24.950
This is where I always walk!

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:25.940
Stop clinging to him!

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:27.380
You walk along the
edge, not near JoJo!

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:30.790
Shut up! He's my
JoJo. Don't touch!

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:34.160
Just go away. Go walk
on the other side!

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.360
You're in my way!

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:37.490
JoJo?

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:39.100
What's wrong?

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:11.430
JoJo!

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:21.530
<i>A cut on my knee? </i>

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:23.200
<i>What's going on? </i>

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.040
<i>Did I get cut by that branch? </i>

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:26.280
<i>No, that's no it</i>

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:27.940
<i>It was cut before I fell</i>

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:30.410
<i>That's why I lost my</i>
<i>footing on the steps</i>

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:32.980
<i>Could he be? </i>

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:35.350
<i>Where is he!? </i>

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:03.720
I'm sure he came this way.

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:09.890
JoJo!

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:14.920
Where did he go?

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:20.090
JoJo!

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:30.110
Oh, good!

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:32.080
I finally found you!

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:38.380
"He's hurt!" I thought, so I
went back to get a bandage.

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:40.380
Just a second...

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:43.590
If you don't mind...

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:44.350
here...

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:45.490
use this!

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:52.960
Thanks.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.530
Oh, my!

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:11.550
What the...?

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:30.390
What is this strength...?

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:32.470
This is no girl's strength!

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:34.560
That's right...

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:38.540
That woman...

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:41.100
has been possessed by my Stand.

00:09:41.880 --> 00:09:43.110
A Stand?

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:44.940
Just who the hell are you!?

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:47.580
KAKYOIN Noriaki.

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:50.980
My Stand's name is
Hierophant Green.

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:53.520
Earlier...

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:55.920
I pledged my
loyalty to Lord Dio.

00:09:56.760 --> 00:09:57.590
Dio!?

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:07.500
Wha...

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:09.140
What is that thing!?

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:14.470
By the way, attacking my Stand...

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:17.410
will end up injuring
that woman, understand?

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:23.020
She cares for you a lot, it seems.

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:49.750
I see...

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:51.910
Now that I've dragged it out,

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:54.610
this Stand sure looks like the type
that has to possess someone.

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:00.550
Don't pretend to be tough...

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:03.320
I can clearly see those grip marks.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.660
Let me choke you
just a little bit more...

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:10.640
After you pass out,
I'll take you to the old man.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:12.770
There, I'll let you talk...

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:14.610
about Dio!

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:23.510
I'll make you regret that...

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:26.420
you dragged out my Stand.

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:59.910
You actually managed to put your guard
up before Hierophant could strike.

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:04.920
My Stand hates to
be in open spaces,

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:07.260
so he always tends to
lurk behind something.

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:09.460
Naturally, if you drag
him out, he'll get angry.

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:11.060
Didn't I tell you?

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:13.930
I will make you
regret dragging it out!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:21.300
Please don't think that's all
my Hierophant is capable of.

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:23.770
What's that...?

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:30.450
Die!

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:32.080
Emerald Splash!

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:58.370
What looked like the bodily
fluids of my Hierophant Green...

00:12:58.780 --> 00:13:01.180
they are visions of
destructive energy!

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:05.740
Sacrificing yourself to protect
a woman... how foolish you are.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:16.790
What do you suppose you
can do with that body?

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:19.690
You're just like a sandbag
before a boxer.

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:23.460
It seems you stand up only
to be beaten down again.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:28.970
I'm branded a so-
called delinquent...

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:32.000
so I'm always beating up
guys who challenge me...

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:36.810
and handing out lessons to those haughty
morons that call themselves teachers.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:39.550
But even I...

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:43.610
can sense a disgusting evil!

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:46.190
An evil...?

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:51.360
An evil is someone who takes
advantage of the weak...

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:53.330
and abuses them
for his own sake!

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:56.030
Are you talking
about that woman?

00:13:56.470 --> 00:13:57.330
Ridiculous!

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:59.200
Let the vanquished be the evil...

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:01.240
and the victor be the just!

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:03.110
How you get there is unimportant!

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:04.840
The vanquished is the evil?

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:06.870
Enough talk!

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:09.010
Take this!

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:10.840
Emerald Splash!

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:13.280
If the vanquished is the evil...

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:32.090
Well, then indeed...

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:40.110
You are the evil one!

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:01.770
Wha... what a powerful Stand...

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:07.800
Where am I...?

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:12.610
What a pain...

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:30.050
Not good...

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:32.450
He won't make it.

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:35.790
What do you mean by that?

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:37.830
Jotaro...

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:39.460
It's not your fault!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:44.700
The reason why this young man pledged
his loyalty to Dio and attacked you...

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:47.100
that reason is right here!

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:56.470
What is this?

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:00.820
That's a "Bud of Flesh"
created from Dio's cells.

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:02.810
A "Bud of Flesh?"

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:07.290
Actually, four months ago...

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:08.930
in Cairo, Egypt...

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:11.830
I met Dio!

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.910
My occupation is fortune-telling.

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:30.910
I had a shop in Cairo, Egypt.

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:37.350
On my way home from the shop,

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:40.860
he appeared silently in front of me...

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:44.520
and creeping into my heart...

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:46.630
was his icy cold gaze.

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:48.570
Hair of spun gold...

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:50.960
his translucent white skin...

00:16:52.310 --> 00:16:55.100
I'd already heard about
him from Mr. Joestar...

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:57.930
so I immediately
recognized him as Dio!

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:03.010
You there...

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:07.310
I've heard you possess an ability
that ordinary people don't have...

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:13.790
I would be pleased if you
would show it to me...

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:20.260
It was then I felt the fear.

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:23.030
The words he spoke...

00:17:23.170 --> 00:17:26.540
were somehow relaxing,
and dangerously sweet...

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:28.600
which made them all
the more terrifying.

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:33.410
I ran...

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:36.680
with no thought of fighting him...

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:39.380
Otherwise...

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:41.680
a Bud of Flesh would've
been implanted in me...

00:17:42.260 --> 00:17:43.860
and just like this young man,

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:47.420
I would have pledged my
absolute loyalty to Dio.

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.030
Also...

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:55.390
my brain would have been consumed
in a few years, and I would have died.

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:57.800
Hold on!

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:04.040
Kakyoin...

00:18:04.510 --> 00:18:05.770
isn't dead yet!

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:07.440
Jotaro!

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:12.620
It will invade the brain of
anyone who tries to remove it!

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:15.790
Don't touch me!

00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:17.680
Without damaging his brain...

00:18:18.020 --> 00:18:19.050
I'll pull this thing out!

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:55.190
Dio!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.000
Jo... JoJo!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:07.300
Youuu...!

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:21.210
<i>Dio! </i>

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:27.020
What's wrong, Jotaro?

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:28.790
Jotaro!

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:39.400
Y... You...

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:40.740
Why...?

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:41.970
Don't move.

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:44.940
If I screw up...

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:46.240
your brain is history.

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:00.160
Jotaro!

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:01.420
It's too dangerous!

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:03.160
Wait... Avdol.

00:20:03.730 --> 00:20:04.560
My grandson...

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:07.030
Jotaro... let's have faith in him!

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:08.970
Look!

00:20:09.070 --> 00:20:11.160
Neither Jotaro nor his
Stand tremble one bit.

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:14.710
More precise than a machine
are its movements...

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:17.370
more powerful... are its motions!

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:27.910
He did it!

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:33.080
Jotaro!

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:37.760
Magician's Red!

00:20:58.880 --> 00:20:59.820
Why...

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:04.450
did you risk your
own life to help me?

00:21:07.390 --> 00:21:08.360
Well...

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:09.920
now that you mention it...

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:12.130
I wish I knew that myself.

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:39.350
What was that?

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:40.650
It came from the kitchen!

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:44.050
It can't be...!

00:21:49.170 --> 00:22:09.820
Holley!

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:12.150
Miss Holley!

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:13.950
Holley...

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:15.280
Hang on!

00:22:15.590 --> 00:22:23.130
Holley!

00:22:25.940 --> 00:22:26.700
Mr. Joestar!

00:22:26.940 --> 00:22:27.840
It can't be...?

00:22:30.110 --> 00:22:33.310
My greatest fear has come to pass...

00:22:35.410 --> 00:22:36.570
Jotaro!

00:22:39.490 --> 00:22:40.420
Old man...

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:41.710
What do you mean by that?

00:22:42.720 --> 00:22:44.520
I'd thought it was strange...

00:22:45.220 --> 00:22:49.520
that because of Dio, Stand abilities
had appeared in Jotaro and I...

00:22:50.130 --> 00:22:52.290
but nothing had
happened to Holley...

00:23:11.650 --> 00:23:15.920
A Stand is essentially called forth
by one's spiritual strength...

00:23:16.460 --> 00:23:18.920
and pressed into action
through fighting instincts.

00:23:19.990 --> 00:23:24.730
However, Ms. Holley's quiet and gentle
nature couldn't control a Stand...

00:23:25.160 --> 00:23:27.790
No, even worse, it's
actually done her harm.

00:23:28.370 --> 00:23:30.930
We've been worried that she
didn't have the power to resist.

00:23:31.670 --> 00:23:35.370
Worried that she didn't have
the power to battle Dio's spell!

00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:40.770
In the past...

00:23:41.110 --> 00:23:44.980
I've known people who died because of
the damage caused by their own Stands.

00:23:46.020 --> 00:23:47.780
But in Ms. Holley's case...

00:23:48.250 --> 00:23:50.050
there is still hope.

00:23:52.020 --> 00:23:53.290
Say it. What needs to be done.

00:23:55.030 --> 00:23:56.290
There's only one way.

00:23:56.700 --> 00:23:59.600
Defeat Dio and
break the spell!

00:24:00.200 --> 00:24:02.630
But... where is Dio?

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:05.390
We don't even have a clue...

00:24:08.040 --> 00:24:09.410
Nile tsetse fly...

00:24:10.410 --> 00:24:13.140
Inhabits the Nile River
regions of Egypt.

00:24:15.150 --> 00:24:15.810
Specifically...

00:24:16.220 --> 00:24:19.780
the one with a striped pattern on its
legs is called the Aswan tsetse fly.

00:24:21.750 --> 00:24:24.690
It's a fax from a place called
the Speed Wagon Foundation.

00:24:27.890 --> 00:24:29.990
Which means... he's...!

00:24:30.560 --> 00:24:31.430
In Egypt?

00:24:31.830 --> 00:24:34.200
He's been in Egypt all this time...

00:24:34.530 --> 00:24:36.060
and in the Aswan region!

00:24:39.540 --> 00:24:40.660
Three months ago...

00:24:41.240 --> 00:24:44.180
my family and I were
traveling in Egypt.

00:24:44.580 --> 00:24:46.700
That was when I met Dio.

00:24:48.010 --> 00:24:48.810
I was...

00:24:49.450 --> 00:24:51.280
terrified by Dio's very existence...

00:24:52.320 --> 00:24:54.480
and I succumbed to him.

00:24:55.350 --> 00:24:58.720
Never again will I go
through that misery.

00:24:59.560 --> 00:25:00.590
Jotaro...

00:25:00.590 --> 00:25:01.990
I'm going to Egypt, too!

00:25:04.930 --> 00:25:06.900
Why would you...?

00:25:07.400 --> 00:25:09.730
Well, now that you mention it...

00:25:10.470 --> 00:25:12.300
I wish I knew that myself.

00:25:18.780 --> 00:25:20.870
Thanks to you, I was able
to come to my senses...

00:25:21.710 --> 00:25:22.910
That's all.

00:25:26.220 --> 00:25:28.380
Holley, I promise I'll save you...

00:25:29.050 --> 00:25:31.320
I promise I'll save you...

00:25:44.070 --> 00:25:46.940
We'll never know when
the enemy might attack.

00:25:47.240 --> 00:25:49.330
So that we don't involve
innocent people...

00:25:49.780 --> 00:25:52.510
we're taking the Speed Wagon
Foundation's private jet!

00:25:53.250 --> 00:25:54.180
Jotaro...

00:25:56.080 --> 00:25:57.010
Before we leave...

00:25:57.650 --> 00:26:00.310
let me give your Stand a name.

00:26:01.790 --> 00:26:05.350
Draw one card from
this Tarot deck.

00:26:10.260 --> 00:26:11.520
The Star card.

00:26:12.100 --> 00:26:12.930
I will name it.

00:26:13.100 --> 00:26:14.570
Your Stand shall be called...

00:26:14.630 --> 00:26:15.790
Star Platinum!

00:26:16.940 --> 00:26:18.530
What this card implies...

00:26:18.940 --> 00:26:23.400
will be revealed through the
journey we are about to begin.

00:26:34.250 --> 00:26:35.740
Alright! Let's go!

00:27:17.400 --> 00:27:18.420
So...

00:27:18.660 --> 00:27:20.390
they figured it out...

00:27:20.900 --> 00:27:22.420
my whereabouts.

00:27:24.840 --> 00:27:25.830
They're coming...

00:27:26.770 --> 00:27:28.000
to Egypt.
